      <activity id="ef28e921-57f3-5893-97ea-5072a3b9dcd4" activityNameId="61b6622f-0dda-5d57-b20e-7fbef265b096" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Disposal, building, door, inner, glass-wood, to final disposal</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Disposal, building, door, inner, glass-wood, to final disposal
The dataset can be applied for a standard inner door (wood-glass) disposal process in Switzerland. Disposal of glazing linked to updated dataset from QualiBob project. Philippe Stolz, September 2016.\nGeography: Dataset represents standard in Europe and/or Switzerland.\nTechnology: The technology in this dataset represents standard incineration technology in Europe. \nVersion: 2.2\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Entsorgungssysteme\nLocal subcategory: Gebäudeentsorgung\nUVEK 2022 source file:07158.XML\n\n
UUID: 0d318b04-c50d-4847-aa8c-e46ccf0da28b
The dataset describes the disposal of a glass-wood inner door in a municipal incineration. All the materials (steel parts, aluminium, rubber, plastics, paints and wood) are disposed in a municipal solid waste incineration. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The technology in this dataset represents standard incineration technology in Europe. 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Calculation from waste composition 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0d318b04-c50d-4847-aa8c-e46ccf0da28b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
